0115<>root<>0<>115<>Is this true ?<>Yangguo<><>00/5/18 02:58<>0<>FlKReNBFzuOu6<><>202.60.224.3<>I have decided to leave EV im afraid. Its been along time coming and I have tried to avoid it by talking to so many people. All say things will get better and &lt;shurg&gt;.<BR><BR>One of the main things that gives me cause to make this decision is the lack of equipment I have been "awarded". I realise that EV has a loot system based upon input and attendance of events, but you may have noticed (though im sure alot of you havent) that I have not been at any events for some time now. There seemd no point. There was a time when I would log on and ALWAYS be at events, PoF, PoH, FGs, even PoS to some extent (though I dont like that place). During that time I have seen 1 item "awarded" to me. These were PoF boots. The only reason I have the boots now is because every other caster had them at the time of the event, so I was told I could take them rather than let them rot. This makes me feel somewhat undervalued. Another time in planes I saw another wizard awarded a croysilk mask because "They did not have a mask item on thier body". Now im sorry to say that angered me alot. There IS a quest for a wizard only mask, and because I made the effort to do that quest, I was ignored in consideration for the mask. I would hope that anyone could understand my upset there. For example if we had a new shaman who joined our guild, and did not have a Breastplate of anykind, im sure latar and doctors would be very upset if the new person was awarded the BP.<BR><BR>I know there has been alot of discussion about loot before, and i know that the officers have a hard time somtimes deciding who gets what, and there is always somone upset, but from 4 months in EV, I would have thought that I could have gotten 1 or 2 more items. I have spoken to many members and most agree that it does seem very strange that I have nothing. &lt;shrug&gt;<BR><BR>Secondly our guild events can be alot of fun, but it seems of late no exp is evvolved. I dont expect to get EXP in the planes at all, but I do at other events. especialy knowing that when I enter the dungeon, Ill walk out empty handed again. However last week I was present at a Chardok raid (when I offered to come over and help corpse recover) and noticed that the LA team (consisting of Linn 2 melee classes and 1 cleric) were getting every single kill. Now I found this hard to understand as all my team were nuking hard and still not getting kills. It was only when I left I scrolled back through text and noticed that thier cleric was using atone right at the end of every battle. For those of you who dont know what that does, it removes the record of all dammage inflicted before the spell was cast. Thus all the dammage we did was removed, and only Linns last nuke was counted as dammage. This was not just one kill, I had the text for 12 kills on my windows, and this tactic was used on each and EVERY kill. I was angry. <BR><BR>I spoke to many people only bloody said "so what" everyone else seemed kinda upset as I was. Now I dont know what you all think, but I find that unfair.<BR><BR>IM getting tired now so Im going to bed. Ill check the message board tomorrow (if the password has not been changed) to see what comments are posted. But I think there are alot of people who are getting increasingly upset latley. I hope you can sort them out to prevent others following me. I wish you all very good luck in the future, and if anyone needs a res (cleric 46 now fast heading for 49 &lt;g&gt;) or a teleport, ill be happy to help (with the exceptance of Latar who can walk &lt;g&gt;). <BR><BR>Best wishes<BR>Tarq<#>0116<>115<>1<>115<>Re:Is this true ?<>Yangguo<><>00/5/18 03:00<>0<>FlKReNBFzuOu6<><>202.60.224.3<>&lt;&lt;&lt;<BR>However last week I was present at a Chardok raid (when I offered to come over and help corpse recover) and noticed that the LA team (consisting of Linn 2 melee classes and 1 cleric) were getting every single kill. Now I found this hard to understand as all my team were nuking hard and still not getting kills. It was only when I left I scrolled back through text and noticed that thier cleric was using atone right at the end of every battle. For those of you who dont know what that does, it removes the record of all dammage inflicted before the spell was cast. Thus all the dammage we did was removed, and only Linns last nuke was counted as dammage. This was not just one kill, I had the text for 12 kills on my windows, and this tactic was used on each and EVERY kill. I was angry. <BR>&gt;&gt;&gt;<#>0119<>116<>2<>115<>Re[2]:Is this true ?<>Celeb<>hatori@remus.dti.ne.jp<>00/5/18 23:35<>0<>FlGKEW6OZzcyo<><>210.170.203.12<>First of all, I notice that my party had much frequently got EXP message during the raid with EV in recent several days.<BR>I never think this situation is better. I sincerely hope it should be solved to keep good collaboration with you.<BR>However, if anyone insists LA team exploits experience points by using illegal or unfair method, my answer is absolute 'No'.<BR><BR>For good solution to reach, I would like to point some facts as follows;<BR><BR>1. I have never heard that Atone (CLR) or Memory blur (ENC) cancels not  only 'hate list' but also 'damage calculation'.<BR>  If it is true, I think it is obvious bug. What is the original information<BR>about this issue?<BR><BR>2. Through the hunting in these days, CLR in my party was not always same<BR>character, sometimes no CLR :p<BR>   However we could usually get EXP as well as the fight at Chardok in this<BR>subject.<BR><BR>I think LA team merely had better damage rate than other parties.<BR>To solve this problem, I feel it is necessary for us ( EV and LA) to arrange more balanced parties during the raid.<BR>Or separate camp points, when we want more EXP rather than rare items and exciting adventure!<BR><BR>Please you notice, Linn the wizard has really incredible power to destroy everything, and it is her task.<BR>Also enchanter's task is to control mobs by mesmerize and charm, not only<BR>deliver clarity everyone :P<BR>According to informal announcement, mesmerize series has same effect as <BR>memory blur.<BR>If those spells have lethal bug, should I never use those spells? OK, it is kidding.<BR><BR>Anyway I hope further good relation with you, thus don't hesitate to contact<BR>me if there are any complains to us in your side.<BR><BR>Kind regards,<BR><BR>Celeb Mirdain  Guild master of Last Alliance<BR><BR><BR><BR><BR><BR><#>0117<>115<>1<>115<>Re:Is this true ?<>Linn<><>00/5/18 05:42<>0<>Fl6HB6Y3eygus<><>210.170.147.81<>Okay, I' m good at KSing, and I guess that Yang is asking us his Secoundly point.<BR><BR>There are 2 things that he pointed out.<BR>1)My nuking<BR>2)Blur thing(Atone and Mem blur)<BR>and these combination makes getting kills.<BR><BR>1st point<BR>   I want to say what is our wizards works? There are 3 points. 1)Kill mob fast, especially mutiple inc 2)Kill them not to run them away. 3)Not gettting attacked by mobs. I know that nuking at the end makes high probability of getting kills, but I'm nuking only at the end not to get attacked unless we need to kill fast. Honestly I want exps also but I can say that exps are not my(our)1st purpose in the raid.(I think that it should be called "raid" if we need 2 or more groups) and ... when I really want to get exps, I WILL NOT GO TO RAID THINGS.<BR>   I dont know that you mentioned which cahrdok raid and how situation we were in.  Basically...when I have enough mana, I tryed to get kills also. So check the spell I casted, If its IC, yes I tryed to get kill or fire resistant mobs prolly. if not it was mana effective nuking. (Mana cost IC:2.8 Draunt of Fire:3.0-3.2) If I slained all mobs, just I casted it in goodtiming.<BR> Its not the point... yes, the problem is combination with blur.<BR><BR>2nd point<BR>   I'm not sure that she casted Atone, but we didnt ask her to cast atone. I dont know what you saw in your chat window and thought she casted atone. I think that It was Celeb's mem blur. He was sometimes casting blur to split the damage that our tanks take.  In addition, the cleric asked me NOT TO GET KILLS A LOT cuz I m good at getting kills! So I believe that it was not her casting or there were some reasons to cast like saving enchaters, healers or the other casters.<BR><BR>   It is true prolly that we got a lot of exps that time, but It sometimes happend cuz of grouping. and I tryed to adjust grouping also( I send a tell to Cnyen, Tib, or Rub, not sure who)<BR>Anyway, WE HAVE NEVER USED THE DAMN WAY TO GET EXPS INTENTHONALY! Once grouped, I try to get kills for the group but my 1st purpose is succeed in the raid. <BR><BR>   And think about the exp split system. Check the Malm's comment that posted 22th February and the titie is "Some notes on KSing". I agree with his estimation and It will explain any "odd" exp splittings. Depending on this system, the tatal damages on a certain mob dont determin which group get the kill.  <BR>   I really want them to make new command to split exps for multple group raid. Its the cause of these kinds of problems.<BR><BR>In addition about loot<BR>   I can say... THE SHIELD FROM CoM IS THE 1ST THING LINN GOT IN(or with) EV EVENT! Yes I got some yet as Graywood but I refused to get plane gear and FG loots even as Linn before. Okay gonna check what I got in the events.<BR>Linn:Runed Ornate shield<BR>Gray:Mace of shadowed souls, Ashenbone abbsi, SK helm, SK bracer,SK arm, Mith torqe <BR>   A lot enough huh?<BR>   I dont complain about my loots, just wanted to say its usual! and Thanks all for the itmes, again.<BR><BR>Group with me to get exps!<BR>Linn Blueray 54th channeler<#>0118<>117<>2<>115<>I  remember the situation<>Linn<><>00/5/18 06:46<>0<>Fl6HB6Y3eygus<><>210.170.147.81<>   I remebered the situation, while medding in solo. It takes like 10min to get FoM.<BR>   It was the last Chardok raid(when Cnyen get his cool shield), and it was the way back where we died beyond the bridge.<BR>   In the CR situation, I really dont care about exps if I get all exps or none. I did the last nukes a lot cuz... remeber why we died and was doing CR. A mob ran away and made a train... So I am convinced that we didnt concentrate to get exps with blur things. We were tired enough(was 5AM) and should had to CR Corty's corpse(Vaice cant summon Corty's corpse cuz they are on same account) also, so didnt do the action which makes us in danger.<BR>   Otherwise  Tarq suddenly gated out while we were still CRing. I couldnt believe his action and his comment...tryed to get exps in the dungeons? It was CR, just should be safe!!<BR><BR>Linn Blueray 54th channeler<BR><#>0120<>118<>3<>115<>Re:I  remember the situation<>Yangguo<><>00/5/19 01:50<>0<>FlKReNBFzuOu6<><>203.85.231.61<>thx for all your reply here.<BR><BR>I Just want to make the things clear, because I am not there.<BR><BR>So sorry, I am not bashing any1 and say anything.<BR><BR>here is tarq's new post :<BR><BR>Applogise...<BR>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------<BR>Hi Man, I came on with the intention of saying I was sorry for appearing to be selfish regarding my previous post, then I read all the replies to my original message. Thanks so much!. I had quite a long discussion with Tib last night (probably this morning really &lt;g&gt; sorry for keeping you up tib). After talking with tib and reading my own message again and thinking long and hard about things I thought I had been somwhat unfair in my comments. But bomb is right, we do need to post feelings here. No point in me quitting and thats it. never hearing from me again. <BR><BR>I also decided that one of my main reasons for being so unhappy latley is I just do not enjoying playing my wizard anymore &lt;g&gt;. Seems I just stand there, press 1 for Ice Commet and 2 for Draught of flame sometimes. Ok then I get really tactical and press 6 to stunn a mob when its casting, or gate when im in trouble. Its so boring. what with that and the fact that Verant seems to have screwed caster drops I was getting so dispondant I guess. <BR><BR>When playing my cleric I feel so much more usful in a group. Yes laara hon I know melee classes can do even less then a wizard to help a group, but a group is not a group without tanks, cleric and enchanter. I feel responsible for 5 players when playing cleric, I can really make a difference. Thats what im missing, and thats what Im going to change. <BR><BR>If your all ok with it, Ill be playing my cleirc with the guild mostly from now on. I know we have more damn clerics now than we have tanks, but hey we can always drop crappy clerics like Prop (whos being played by ton whos also in oot and whale whos also in tim-deep &lt;g&gt;). My cleric hit 46 last night &lt;Cheer&gt; and will be 47 in a few hours. I WILL be at more events. For those of you who dont know, I dont work right now due to being off work Ill. Have been for many years now, so my time is quite free. Just did not choose to come online at the right times. I can be, and will be about alot more now and lookforward to putting a more posative contribution into things. I especialy cant wait to give Latar a 29 revive!!<BR><BR>Best wishes, see you soon<BR><BR>Tarq<BR><BR><BR>And I will post all of your reply on this post to EV members board.<BR><BR>I really suggest LA guild got our member board's password.<BR><BR>U can ask any officer in our guild to get it.<BR><BR>This isn't discussed, but I will talk to other officer very soon.<BR><BR>Good day to u all.
